    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this beautiful 3 bedroom mid terrace property to the market for sale. \n\nThis beautifully presented three-bedroom mid-terrace property is ideally located in Ruanbeg Close, within the popular Ruanbeg Manor development in Kildare.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out and maintained to a high standard throughout. On the ground floor, the property comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and spacious kitchen/dining room, a comfortable living room, and a convenient downstairs WC. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from its own ensuite. A family bathroom and hot press complete the first-floor accommodation.\n\nExternally, the property offers excellent outdoor space. The front garden is low-maintenance, while the bright and spacious rear garden features a patio area, raised flowerbeds and a block-built garden shed, providing excellent additional storage.\n\nOverall, this is a well-maintained and attractive home offering comfortable accommodation and generous outdoor space in a popular residential location.\n\nViewing of this property comes highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only. \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, alarm point\n\nKitchen/Dining: Wooden flooring, recessed spot lights and light fittings, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, ceramic sink, oven, hob, extractor fan, kitchen island and storage\n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, light fitting, feature fireplace \n\nMaster Bedroom: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobes \n\nEnsuite: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, shower unit, WHB, WC \n\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring, fully fitted wardrobe \n\nBedroom 3: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe and storage \n\nFamily Bathroom: Tiled floor to ceiling, bath with shower, WHB, WC \n\nFeatures:\n\nFully alarmed\nPVC front door\nPVC double glazed windows\nSelected carpets, curtains and light fittings included\nOutside tap\nOutside lights\nPatio area to rear\nBlock built shed to rear\nNatural gas heating system\nMains water\nMains sewage\nBuilt in 2002\nc.133.58sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
